// ==============================================================================
// 👑 LIPI UNIVERSE SOVEREIGN DOCUMENTATION GENERATOR (tools/universe_docgen.lp)
// ⚡ 100% Pure Sovereign Lipi Machine Code Engine | 0% C | 0% Libc | 0% Python
// ==============================================================================
//
// WHY: In the sovereign Lipi philosophy, documentation is not an afterthought
// generated by third-party external tools (like Doxygen, Sphinx, or JSDoc).
